OL,3,ATwo men arrested after boy injured in
OL,4,Asword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a boy have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a teenager was injured in an
OL,8,Fattack involving a sword near two
OL,9,Fschools in Gloucester.
OL,11,FSt Peter's High School and Willow
OL,12,FPrimary Academy, in Tuffley, were put
OL,13,Finto lockdown after the incident at
OL,14,F08:50 GMT on Friday.
OL,16,FPolice said a 17-year-old suffered a
OL,17,Fwound "believed to have been caused by
OL,18,Fthe sword".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
